Q20. dataclasses.FrozenInstanceError: cannot assign to field
     'failure_attempt_ids'
================================================================================
A20. frozen=True blocks every assignment after construction.

     Option 1, build a new instance:
         from dataclasses import replace
         episode = replace(episode,
             failure_attempt_ids=episode.failure_attempt_ids + (a.attempt_id,))

     Option 2, accumulate first and construct once (better fit):
         failures = []; recovery_id = None
         for a in attempts:
             if a.result is AttemptResult.FAILURE:
                 failures.append(a.attempt_id)
             else:
                 recovery_id = a.attempt_id
                 break
         episode = RecoveryEpisode(..., failure_attempt_ids=tuple(failures),
                                   recovery_attempt_id=recovery_id)


